# Copied into website/ (the document root) by the build. Applies only where
# Apache allows overrides for this directory; the reverse-proxy mounts for the
# session broker (/auth/, /registry/) cannot be set here — see README.md §6.

# Serve existing files as-is and every other path with the SPA shell, so
# client-side routes (/campaigns, /new, /<campaign>) resolve.
FallbackResource /spa.html
